    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant kingdom ruled by ambition and fire, an aging monarch dreams of expanding his legacy. Obsessed with conquest, he sends his sons to subjugate the neighboring provinces \u2014 once peaceful lands now protected by a mysterious and fiercely resistant coven of witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707030/extras/9e3b52eb197b311e042f9e6e6fcfe01f.avif?t=1750406543\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fate has no loyalty to bloodlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During one of these brutal campaigns, the king\u2019s eldest son \u2014 his pride, his heir \u2014 falls in battle, slain by arcane forces that no sword can match. Grief soon turns to rage. And rage calls for vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707030/extras/90e7cc063b0c2e257c584395709b69eb.avif?t=1750406543\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate to strike back, the king seeks out a warlock long banished from the royal court. The warlock offers help \u2014 but not the kind the king expects. Through a dark and forbidden ritual, he raises the fallen prince from the grave\u2026 not as a man, but as something else. Something hungry. Twisted. Unnatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707030/extras/44b100925f3426e711b5ea589dc1ecc1.avif?t=1750406543\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, a creature of lust and undeath walks the earth once more, driven by a primal desire to defile and destroy the witches who ended his life \u2014 one coven at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tale of power, corruption, forbidden resurrection\u2026 and the sinful magic that binds them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explicit adult scenes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning  HQ artwork </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating dark fantasy narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters including seductive witches and corrupted royalty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive mini-games and exploration sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes of taboo, transformation, and magical domination</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a distant kingdom ruled by ambition and fire, an aging monarch dreams of expanding his legacy. Obsessed with conquest, he sends his sons to subjugate the neighboring provinces \u2014 once peaceful lands now protected by a mysterious and fiercely resistant coven of witches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707030/extras/9e3b52eb197b311e042f9e6e6fcfe01f.avif?t=1750406543\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But fate has no loyalty to bloodlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During one of these brutal campaigns, the king\u2019s eldest son \u2014 his pride, his heir \u2014 falls in battle, slain by arcane forces that no sword can match. Grief soon turns to rage. And rage calls for vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707030/extras/90e7cc063b0c2e257c584395709b69eb.avif?t=1750406543\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate to strike back, the king seeks out a warlock long banished from the royal court. The warlock offers help \u2014 but not the kind the king expects. Through a dark and forbidden ritual, he raises the fallen prince from the grave\u2026 not as a man, but as something else. Something hungry. Twisted. Unnatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707030/extras/44b100925f3426e711b5ea589dc1ecc1.avif?t=1750406543\" width=614 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, a creature of lust and undeath walks the earth once more, driven by a primal desire to defile and destroy the witches who ended his life \u2014 one coven at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a tale of power, corruption, forbidden resurrection\u2026 and the sinful magic that binds them all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explicit adult scenes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning  HQ artwork </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating dark fantasy narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters including seductive witches and corrupted royalty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive mini-games and exploration sequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes of taboo, transformation, and magical domination</p></li></ul>",
